    "detailed_description": "Battle your way through waves of zombies, military commands, gangs without heart, ninjas skilled and ruthless mobsters.<br><br>Take the role of Alexia or Charlie, two people with special abilities, on a mission to rescue Megan, who has been<br>kidnapped for unknown reasons.<br><br>To rescue Megan you must use unique moves, and special combinations, motorcycles, super powers, and more.<br><br>Unleash the fighter in you with incredible martial skills and mysterious powers you'll discover in your<br>amazing adventure<br><br>Discover how to defeat each of their powerful bosses, and develops the Charlie and Alexia skills as you go and<br>get experience.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Thrilling shooter levels<br></li><li> Amazing aerial combos<br></li><li> Fighting action packed levels<br></li><li> 5 unique bosses, each requires a different strategies to be defeate</li></ul>",
